{
  "_README": [
    "Copy this file to scripts/dominicks_manifest.json and fill in either `base_url`",
    "or per-file `url`. The downloader builds each URL as `{base_url}/{filename}` if",
    "no per-file `url` is set.",
    "",
    "To populate URLs:",
    "  1. Sign the Kilts agreement at https://www.chicagobooth.edu/research/kilts/research-data/dominicks",
    "  2. Open the download page they give you.",
    "  3. Right-click each download link and copy the URL. If they all share a common",
    "     prefix (likely), set `base_url` once and leave per-file `url` blank.",
    "  4. The Kilts archive ships either .zip per file (older) or loose .csv (newer).",
    "     If your page lists .csv, change every filename below from .zip to .csv.",
    "",
    "There are 56 files: 27 movement (w*.zip) + 27 UPC (upc*.zip) + 2 metadata.",
    "Comment in JSON: any key starting with `_` is ignored by the downloader."
  ],
